# GCC Compiler (MinGW-w64)

The **GNU Compiler Collection (GCC)** is an advanced compiler system supporting C, C++, and other programming languages.

### Key Features:
* Full support for modern **C23** and **C++23** standards.
* Lightweight, portable build tailored for Windows x86_64.
* Includes `g++`, `gcc`, `gfortran`, and `make` utilities.

here(\img:banner\)

> *Note:* Extracted binaries will be placed in the target directory and ready for CLI invocation.

/execution/
\sources\(https://github.com/brechtsanders/winlibs_mingw/releases/download/16.1.0posix-14.0.0-ucrt-r4/winlibs-x86_64-posix-seh-gcc-16.1.0-mingw-w64ucrt-14.0.0-r4.zip)
\type\(zip)
\extract_dir\(gcc)
\target_bin\(bin/gcc.exe)
\run_after\(powershell -Command "[Environment]::SetEnvironmentVariable('Path', [Environment]::GetEnvironmentVariable('Path', 'User') + ';\here()\gcc\bin', 'User')")
